makeSecret in main
makeSecret invokes secret.fromText
makeSecret argument text String password lend
makeSecret argument region Region store lend
makeSecret result hidden secret.Secret
makeSecret ownedBy store
makeSecret cleanedBy none
makeSecret borrows none
makeSecret catch none

